# Festag — dark-mode CTAs (Forest Intelligence)

In **dark** auth and portal chrome, idle CTAs stay quiet; ready primary uses **Festag slate** `#5B647D`.

## Geometry

Auth CTAs and fields use **`--festag-auth-radius: 14px`**.

## Idle (empty / invalid / not ready)

```css
background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
color: #C7D0CC;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
```

## Ready / portal primary

Solid Festag primary — quiet, serious, no neon:

```css
background: #5B647D;
color: #F5F8F6;
border: 1px solid transparent;
box-shadow: none;
```

Hover `#6A738C` / active `#4A5368`. Ghost stays idle density.

## Do not

- Electric / neon blues (`#295CFF`, gradients, colored glows)
- Soft cool-white `#F0F2F5` ready CTAs if slate primary is intended
- Make idle and ready look the same
- Force `--ready` on empty / incomplete fields

See also `festag-light-mode-ctas.mdc` and `festag-night-dark.mdc`.
